Choice LearningResourceChoice
    documentation "This choice type represents the available options for providing details necessary to describe a LearningResource."
    shared string LearningResourceMetadataURI
        documentation "The URI (typical a URL) pointing to the metadata entry in a LRMI metadata repository, which describes this content item."
        is required
    inline common LearningResource
        documentation "This entity maintains information that describes content, materials, and informational resources that support learning."
        is required
